### get cats
GET {{apiUrl}}/cats
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

### get cat by id
GET {{apiUrl}}/cats/8

### get cat by id (FAIL: not found)
GET {{apiUrl}}/cats/98

# cat_name, weight, owner, filename, birthdate
### post new cat
POST {{apiUrl}}/cats
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "cat_name": "Rolle",
    "birthdate": "2022-10-10",
    "weight": 4,
    "owner": "Tiina",
    "filename": "https://placecats.com/310/240"
}

### post cat WITH IMAGE
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/cats HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MyBoundary
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="cat_name"

Dogi
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="weight"

4
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="birthdate"

2022-10-08
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="dog.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./dog.jpg
--MyBoundary--

### post cat MISSING FILE for error testing
POST http://127.0.0.1:3000/api/v1/cats HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=MyBoundary
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="cat_name"

Dogi
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="weight"

4
--MyBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="birthdate"

2022-10-08

--MyBoundary--

### edit existing cat
PUT {{apiUrl}}/cats/48
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "weight": 6,
    "cat_name": "Uusi nimi"
}

### delete cat by id
DELETE {{apiUrl}}/cats/48


## /users resource

### Register new user
POST {{apiUrl}}/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "matti12",
    "username": "matti643",
    "email": "matti64example.com",
    "password": "salainen"
}


## /auth resource

### User login
# @name login
POST {{apiUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "matti",
    "password": "salakala"
}

### Get my user info
GET http://localhost:3000/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.token}}

